	(text "Shared power nets: +3V3, VSYS, BAT+, GND. I2C1 is shared by keyboard, charger and gauge.\nSignal connectivity crosses explicit sheet pins. Display connector + SWD + LSE are on MCU.\nRead hardware/WIRING_REVIEW.md for the pin map, net checks and remaining physical validation."
